r\n# 🐞 bug report\r\n\r\n### Affected Package\r\n<!-- Can you pin-point one or more @angular/* packages as the source of the bug? -->\r\n@angular/forms\r\n\r\n\r\n### Is this a regression?\r\n\r\nNot that I know of.\r\n\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nWhen you add a CVA to a form via the FormControlDirective directive or FormControlName directive with reactive forms and the CVA has implemented setDisabledState the the setDisabledState and the FormControl instance is enabled, setDisabledState is not called on the CVA instance, it is however called with the FormControl is disabled.\r\n\r\n## 🔬 Minimal Reproduction\r\n\r\nhttps://stackblitz.com/edit/angular-issue-repro2-3fagzc\r\n\r\n\r\n## 🌍  Your Environment\r\n\r\n**Angular Version:**\r\n<pre><code>\r\n\r\ngoogle3 head\r\n\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n**Anything else relevant?**\r\n\r\nNope\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"jessicajaniuk","id":72768744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzY4NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72768744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk","html_url":"https://github.com/jessicajaniuk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jessicajaniuk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/35309/reactions","total_count":18,"+1":15,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"conf